\paragraph{}The purpose of this lab is to develop a familiarization for transformer usage in two common situations.
First we will create a three phase transformer bank in a delta-wye configuration and look at how the bank and
phase voltage, current and power compare with calculated values. This type of transformer bank is common on 
industrial sites using heavy equipment and large three phase motors. The second type of transformer bank is 
for residential use cases and uses only two phases.     

